  "name": "Question 4",
  "problem": "Translate the following phrase into an algebraic expression: \"The product of a number and $3$ more than that same number.\"",
  "worked_solution": "If we denote our number by $a$, then ''$3$ more than that number'' can be written as\n\n$$\n3+a.\n$$\n\nSo, the whole phrase can be written as\n\n$$\na\\cdot (3+a).\n$$",
